7	 * detection on {@code POST /api/owners} is expressed through, and the {@code identityKey} field the
8	 * owner response carries. The key is the lower-case hex {@code SHA-256} of
9	 * {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + lowerEmail + '|' + soundex(lastName)}; two owners are the same
10	 * identity exactly when their keys are equal.
